            group.long 0x28++0x03
                line.long 0x00 "CAN_WORD_28,CAN Controller WORD 28 Register"
                    bitfld.long 0x00 31. "SACK,Self-Acknowledge" "0: no self-ACK,1: self-ACK when LBME=1"
                    bitfld.long 0x00 30. "ROM,In case of a full RBUF when a new message is received then ROM selects the following" "0: The oldest message will be overwritten,1: The new message will not be stored"
                    newline
                    rbitfld.long 0x00 29. "ROV,ROV is cleared by setting RREL=1" "0: No Overflow,1: Overflow"
                    bitfld.long 0x00 28. "RREL,The host controller has read the actual RB slot and releases it" "0: NO_RELEASE,1: Release - The host has read the RB"
                    newline
                    bitfld.long 0x00 27. "RBALL,Receive Buffer stores ALL data frames" "0: normal operation,1: RB stores correct data frames as well as data.."
                    rbitfld.long 0x00 24.--25. "RSTAT,Receive buffer Status" "0: EMPTY,1: greater than empty and less than almost full..,2: greater than or equal to almost full..,3: full (stays set in case of overflow - for.."
                    newline
                    bitfld.long 0x00 23. "FD_ISO,ISO CAN FD mode has a different CRC initialization value and an additional stuff bit count" "0: Bosch CAN FD (non-ISO) mode,1: ISO CAN FD mode (ISO 11898-1:2015)"
                    bitfld.long 0x00 22. "TSNEXT,After all frame bytes are written to the TBUF registers the host controller has to set TSNEXT to signal that this slot has been filled" "0: no action,1: STB slot filled select next slot"
                    newline
                    bitfld.long 0x00 21. "TSMODE,In FIFO mode frames are transmitted in the order in that they are written into the STB" "0: FIFO mode,1: priority decision mode"
