                    rbitfld.long 0x00 16.--17. "TSSTAT,If TTEN=0 or TTTBM=0: 00 -STB is empty" "0: PTB and STB are empty,1: PTB and STB are not empty and not full,2: STB is more than half full,3: PTB and STB are full"
