                    bitfld.long 0x00 26. "MES,MES defines the side which will be hit by the next memory error together with MEL" "0: Host side,1: CAN side"
                    bitfld.long 0x00 24.--25. "MEL,MEL defines the memory area which will be hit by the next memory error together with MES" "0: ACF,1: TBUF,2: RBUF,3: ACF"
