    group.long 0xB10++0x03
        line.long 0x00 "MAC_System_Time_Seconds_Update,The System Time Seconds Update register along with the System Time Nanoseconds Update register initializes or updates the system time maintained by the MAC"
            hexmask.long 0x00 0.--31. 1. "TSS,Timestamp Seconds The value in this field is the seconds part of the update"
