            bitfld.long 0x00 18. "ESTIS,EST (TAS- 802.1Qbv) Interrupt Status This bit indicates an interrupt event during the operation of 802.1Qbv" "0: EST (TAS- 802.1Qbv) Interrupt status not..,1: EST (TAS- 802.1Qbv) Interrupt status detected"
            newline
