        line.long 0x00 "DMA_CH0_TxDesc_Tail_Pointer,The Channel0 Tx Descriptor Tail Pointer register points to an offset from the base and indicates the location of the last valid descriptor"
            hexmask.long 0x00 3.--31. 1. "TDTP,Transmit Descriptor Tail Pointer This field contains the tail pointer for the Tx descriptor ring"
