        line.long 0x00 "DMA_CH0_Current_App_TxBuffer,The Channel0 Current Application Transmit Buffer Address register points to the current Tx buffer address read by the DMA"
            hexmask.long 0x00 0.--31. 1. "CURTBUFAPTR,Application Transmit Buffer Address Pointer The DMA updates this pointer during Tx operation"
