            bitfld.long 0x00 2.--5. "ADDR_L,This bit defines Length of Address to be transmitted" "0: No Address,1: 4 bit Address length,2: 8 bit Address length,3: 12 bit Address length,4: 16 bit Address length,5: 20 bit Address length,6: 24 bit Address length,7: 28 bit Address length,8: 32 bit Address length,9: 36 bit Address length,10: 40 bit Address length,11: 44 bit Address length,12: 48 bit Address length,13: 52 bit Address length,14: 56 bit Address length,15: 60 bit Address length"
