            newline
            bitfld.long 0x00 16. "TXFIFO_RESETA,For lane A Reset TX Data FIFO 1'b0 --> FIFO is in reset 1'b1 --> FIFO is operating FIFO should be held in reset until TXPLL_LOCK=1'b1 and clocks are stable" "0,1"
