            newline
            bitfld.long 0x00 27.--29. "TXDRVA,Enable for driver segments 2 to 8 (of 8) transmitter lane A Segment 1 is active while TXPDA=1'b0 TXDRVA=3'b000 --> Active Segments: 1 TXDRVA=3'b001 --> Active Segments: 1 2 TXDRVA=3'b010 --> Active Segments: 1 2 3 TXDRVA=3'b011 --> Active.." "0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7"
