            bitfld.long 0x00 5. "LFPS_STARTA,For Transmitter channel A Start indicator for LFPS Driver Control LFPS Signaling consists of transmitting the TXPLL Reference clock in the following manner: High drive for LFPS_TBURSTA clock periods Electrical Idle for.." "0,1"
