            newline
            bitfld.long 0x00 2. "DISABLE_CDRGATEA,Disable CDR Datapath/Clock Gating when operating in DFE or EM mode lane A 1'b0 --> When PDDFEA=1'b0 or PDEMA=1'b0 CDR Datapath and Clock is disabled 1'b1 --> When PDDFEA=1'b0 or PDEMA=1'b0 CDR Datapath and Clock remains active Active.." "0,1"
